// BorderNames - the border and shading names Word's schema allows
// (ST_Border and ST_Shd of WordprocessingML): the values the
// formatting commands accept for a border side's w:val and a w:shd's
// w:val (./FormatCheck). The reader keeps any name it finds; only a
// command is held to these.
//
//   BORDER_VALS   Set of the 193 ST_Border names ('nil', 'none',
//                 'single', ... 'custom'), in the schema's order
//   SHD_VALS      Set of the 38 ST_Shd names ('nil', 'clear',
//                 'solid', the stripes and crosses, 'pct5'...'pct95')
// Pure: no desktop services.

